# std.convert: the conversion trait `From`
# (spec/lang/09-traits.md#conversion-trait). It is not a prelude name
# (module.prelude.from-error); the prelude uses it, so postfix `?` finds it
# without an import (module.prelude.question-from).

## The general conversion trait: `from(value)` builds a `Self` from a `T`, and postfix `?` finds it without an import.
## See [trait.from.module](../../spec/lang/09-traits.md#r-trait.from.module).
pub trait From[T]:
    fn from(value: T) -> Self
